    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(40px,6vw,96px);align-items:center">
      <div style="flex:0 1 280px;min-width:0;display:flex;justify-content:center">
        <div style="position:relative;width:min(100%,240px);aspect-ratio:4/5;margin:0 16px 16px 0"><div aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;inset:16px -16px -16px 16px;background:#F3B258;border-radius:24px"></div>
        <img src="/assets/images/grace-founder.jpg" alt="Grace Landry in a hospital bed after getting sick with POTS, giving a thumbs up" style="position:relative;display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;border-radius:24px;background:#ECE6DC"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="flex:1 1 420px;min-width:0">
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font:700 13px/1 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#69727F">Why I started Krue</p>
        <h2 style="margin:0;font:800 clamp(34px,4.6vw,58px)/1.04 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-0.035em;color:#14325A;text-wrap:balance">I started Krue because I've <span class="k-hl" style="--hl:#F9DCAE">lived this.</span></h2>
        <p style="margin:24px 0 0;font:500 clamp(19px,1.7vw,23px)/1.55 var(--font-display);color:#14325A;text-wrap:pretty">“When I suddenly got sick with POTS, I was diagnosed and sent home with a pamphlet. I had to figure it out and piece everything together on my own. Krue is the partner I wish I'd had.”</p>
        <p style="margin:20px 0 0;font:700 15px/1.4 var(--font-display);color:#14325A">Grace Landry, Founder</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUST: privacy and security, three plain-language promises -->
  <section id="trust" style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(16px,4vw,40px);padding-right:clamp(16px,4vw,40px);box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:clamp(80px,11vw,160px)">
    <div style="max-width:44rem">
      <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font:700 13px/1 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#69727F">Privacy and security</p>
      <h2 style="margin:0;font:800 clamp(34px,4.6vw,58px)/1.04 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-0.035em;color:#14325A;text-wrap:balance">Your health information <span class="k-hl" style="--hl:#C4EBF9">stays yours.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="t-grid">
      <div class="t-card"><span class="t-ic" style="background:#E2F5FC;color:#1F7FA3"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2.5"/><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg></span><h3 class="t-h">Your information is protected.</h3><p class="t-p">Your information is encrypted when it’s sent and when it’s stored.</p></div>
      <div class="t-card"><span class="t-ic" style="background:#E3F2EC;color:#3E7F66"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/><path d="M12 3l7 3v6c0 4.5-3 7.5-7 9-4-1.5-7-4.5-7-9V6z"/></svg></span><h3 class="t-h">Your information stays private.</h3><p class="t-p">Your health information is yours. You decide what to share and with whom.</p></div>
      <div class="t-card"><span class="t-ic" style="background:#FCE6F0;color:#A93E72"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h4M12 17h8"/><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="2"/><circle cx="10" cy="17" r="2"/></svg></span><h3 class="t-h">You’re in control.</h3><p class="t-p">Access your information, download a copy, or delete it when you want.</p></div>
