  </section>

  <!-- FAQ: hairlines only -->
  <section id="faq" style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(16px,4vw,40px);padding-right:clamp(16px,4vw,40px);box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:clamp(80px,11vw,160px)">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,72px)">
      <div style="flex:1 1 260px"><h2 style="margin:0;font:800 clamp(34px,4.6vw,58px)/1.04 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-0.035em;color:#14325A;text-wrap:balance">Questions</h2></div>
      <div style="flex:2 1 480px;min-width:0;border-bottom:1px solid #ECE6DC">
        <details style="border-top:1px solid #ECE6DC;padding:22px 0"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;font:700 clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px)/1.35 var(--font-display);color:#14325A">Who is Krue for?<span class="plus" style="flex:none;font:500 26px/1 var(--font-display);color:#69727F;transition:transform .2s">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0;font:400 clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px)/1.6 var(--font-body);color:#3B4656;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:12px;max-width:44rem">People living with complex or multiple chronic conditions who see multiple providers, like doctors, therapists, nurses, and advocates.</p></details><details style="border-top:1px solid #ECE6DC;padding:22px 0"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;font:700 clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px)/1.35 var(--font-display);color:#14325A">How is Krue different from ChatGPT or a note-taking app?<span class="plus" style="flex:none;font:500 26px/1 var(--font-display);color:#69727F;transition:transform .2s">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0;font:400 clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px)/1.6 var(--font-body);color:#3B4656;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:12px;max-width:44rem">A chatbot answers one question at a time. A note app saves one appointment. Krue stays with you. It helps you get ready, keeps your notes and to-dos in one place, and links what each provider said.</p></details><details style="border-top:1px solid #ECE6DC;padding:22px 0"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;font:700 clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px)/1.35 var(--font-display);color:#14325A">Is it okay to record my appointment?<span class="plus" style="flex:none;font:500 26px/1 var(--font-display);color:#69727F;transition:transform .2s">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0;font:400 clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px)/1.6 var(--font-body);color:#3B4656;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:12px;max-width:44rem">Before each recording, Krue asks you to confirm your provider has agreed.</p></details><details style="border-top:1px solid #ECE6DC;padding:22px 0"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;font:700 clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px)/1.35 var(--font-display);color:#14325A">Does Krue replace my doctor?<span class="plus" style="flex:none;font:500 26px/1 var(--font-display);color:#69727F;transition:transform .2s">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0;font:400 clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px)/1.6 var(--font-body);color:#3B4656;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:12px;max-width:44rem">No. Krue does not tell you what's wrong or what to take. It helps you get ready, remember, and follow up.</p></details><details style="border-top:1px solid #ECE6DC;padding:22px 0"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;font:700 clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px)/1.35 var(--font-display);color:#14325A">Do I need to track symptoms or connect devices?<span class="plus" style="flex:none;font:500 26px/1 var(--font-display);color:#69727F;transition:transform .2s">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0;font:400 clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px)/1.6 var(--font-body);color:#3B4656;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:12px;max-width:44rem">No daily logging or devices needed. If you notice a symptom, jot it down, and Krue will help you add it to your next appointment to bring up.</p></details><details style="border-top:1px solid #ECE6DC;padding:22px 0"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;font:700 clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px)/1.35 var(--font-display);color:#14325A">Is Krue HIPAA compliant?<span class="plus" style="flex:none;font:500 26px/1 var(--font-display);color:#69727F;transition:transform .2s">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0;font:400 clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px)/1.6 var(--font-body);color:#3B4656;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:12px;max-width:44rem">HIPAA covers doctors, hospitals, and health plans. Krue is a tool you use on your own, so HIPAA doesn’t apply in the same way. We still protect your health information with care, and you decide what to share.</p></details><details style="border-top:1px solid #ECE6DC;padding:22px 0"><summary style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;font:700 clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px)/1.35 var(--font-display);color:#14325A">Does it work on my phone?<span class="plus" style="flex:none;font:500 26px/1 var(--font-display);color:#69727F;transition:transform .2s">+</span></summary><p style="margin:0;font:400 clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px)/1.6 var(--font-body);color:#3B4656;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:12px;max-width:44rem">Yes. Krue runs in your phone's browser, so there's nothing to download.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ClosingStart />
  </main>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  /* Home-only styles from the reference <head> (trust cards, quote band, testimonials). */
    .t-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:clamp(32px,4vw,48px)}
    .t-card{background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #ECE6DC;border-radius:24px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;transition:transform 200ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1),box-shadow 200ms}
    .t-card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(20,50,90,.08)}
    .t-ic{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:4px}
    .t-h{margin:0;font:700 20px/1.25 var(--font-display);color:#14325A}
    .t-p{margin:0;font:400 16px/1.55 var(--font-body);color:#3B4656;text-wrap:pretty}
    .t-flag{align-self:flex-start;margin-top:4px;font:600 12px/1.3 var(--font-body);color:#6B5400;background:#FFF3B0;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 7px}
    @media (max-width:760px){.t-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.t-card{padding:20px}}
    .q-band{background:#14325A;padding:clamp(64px,9vw,120px) clamp(16px,4vw,40px)}
    .q-band-in{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}
    .q-band-s{margin:0;font:800 clamp(34px,5vw,64px)/1.08 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.035em;color:#FFFFFF;text-wrap:balance}
    .q-band-src{margin:18px 0 0;font:500 13px/1.4 var(--font-body);color:#A9BCD6}
    .q-statband{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center}
    .q-statband .i-thread{z-index:0}
    .q-statband:hover .i-t1,.q-statband.k-awake .i-t1{stroke:#E2169E}
    .q-statband:hover .i-t2,.q-statband.k-awake .i-t2{stroke:#3ABAE8;transition-delay:80ms}
    .q-statband:hover .i-t3,.q-statband.k-awake .i-t3{stroke:#D6E626;transition-delay:160ms}
    .q-stat{position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;background:#FBF8F4;padding:28px 40px;border-radius:28px;max-width:420px;box-sizing:border-box}
    .q-stat b{display:block;white-space:nowrap;font:800 clamp(56px,7vw,96px)/1 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.045em;color:#14325A}
    .q-stat span{display:block;margin-top:12px;font:500 clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px)/1.45 var(--font-body);color:#3B4656;text-wrap:balance}
    .q-sub{margin:18px auto 0;max-width:36rem;font:400 clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px)/1.6 var(--font-body);color:#3B4656}
    .q-grid{margin-top:clamp(36px,4.5vw,56px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px)}
    .q-card{margin:0;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:24px;padding:clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(20,50,90,.06),0 14px 32px rgba(20,50,90,.08);border-top:5px solid var(--qc)}
    .q-mark{font:800 64px/.8 var(--font-display);color:var(--qc);height:34px}
    .q-h{margin:14px 0 12px;font:800 clamp(21px,1.9vw,26px)/1.15 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#14325A;text-wrap:balance}
    .q-b{margin:0 0 22px;font:400 clamp(16px,1.3vw,17px)/1.6 var(--font-body);color:#3B4656;text-wrap:pretty;flex:1}
    .q-cap{padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #ECE6DC;font:700 12px/1.4 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#69727F}
    .q-cond{display:block;margin-top:6px;font:500 14px/1.45 var(--font-body);letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;color:#69727F}
    .q-cap .pv-c{background:#FFF3B0;color:#6B5400;border-radius:6px;padding:1px 6px;letter-spacing:.04em}
    @media (max-width:860px){.q-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:560px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}}
    @media (max-width:640px){.q-statband .i-thread{display:block;left:-16px;right:-16px;width:calc(100% + 32px)}.q-stat{padding:24px 20px}}
  /* Initial "How it works" state; home.js updates these on scroll. */
  :root{--cur0:#7AD1EF;--curfg0:#14325A;--so0:1;--sy0:0px;--cur1:#F4F8D2;--curfg1:#6E7A0C;--so1:0;--sy1:14px;--cur2:#FCE6F0;--curfg2:#A93E72;--so2:0;--sy2:14px;--cur3:#E4EDF8;--curfg3:#235592;--so3:0;--sy3:14px;--activeTint:#E2F5FC}
